$('finish-district').addEventListener('click',finishDistrict);$('cancel-district').addEventListener('click',()=>{state.draft=[];setTool('select');});$('remove-vertex').addEventListener('click',()=>{state.draft.pop();renderToolState();renderMap();});
$('zoom-in').addEventListener('click',()=>setZoom(state.zoom+.25));$('zoom-out').addEventListener('click',()=>setZoom(state.zoom-.25));$('zoom-fit').addEventListener('click',resetZoom);
$('place-search').addEventListener('input',renderList);$('place-list').addEventListener('click',event=>{const button=event.target.closest('[data-select]');if(button)selectAnnotation(button.dataset.select);});
$('map-context').addEventListener('click',event=>{const button=event.target.closest('[data-context]');if(!button||!state.context)return;const{point,refs}=state.context,kind=button.dataset.context;$('map-context').hidden=true;if(kind==='district'){setTool('district');state.draft=[snapPoint(point)];renderToolState();renderMap();}else if(kind==='building')addBuilding(point,refs);else beginAnnotation(kind,point);});
$('map-render').addEventListener('click',event=>{if(suppressClick)return;const annotation=event.target.closest('[data-annotation]');if(state.player){if(annotation)selectAnnotation(annotation.dataset.annotation);return;}if(state.tool==='pan')return;const p=mapPoint(event),refs=refsAtPoint(p,refsFromTarget(event.target));if(state.tool==='district'){addDistrictPoint(p);return;}if(state.tool==='building'){addBuilding(p,refs);return;}if(state.tool==='pin'||state.tool==='text'){beginAnnotation(state.tool,p);return;}if(annotation){selectAnnotation(annotation.dataset.annotation);return;}state.selected=null;renderList();renderProperties();showContext(p,event,refs);});
$('map-render').addEventListener('keydown',event=>{if(event.key!=='Enter'&&event.key!==' ')return;const a=event.target.closest('[data-annotation]');if(a){event.preventDefault();selectAnnotation(a.dataset.annotation);}});
$('save-map').addEventListener('click',saveMap);$('copy-link').addEventListener('click',copyLink);$('open-saved').addEventListener('click',()=>{renderSaved();$('saved-dialog').showModal();});$('open-help').addEventListener('click',()=>$('help-dialog').showModal());
document.querySelectorAll('[data-close]').forEach(button=>button.addEventListener('click',()=>$(button.dataset.close).close()));document.querySelectorAll('dialog').forEach(dialog=>dialog.addEventListener('click',event=>{if(event.target===dialog){const r=dialog.getBoundingClientRect();if(event.clientX<r.left||event.clientX>r.right||event.clientY<r.top||event.clientY>r.bottom)dialog.close();}}));
